## Error / rollback matrix

| Failure | Operator action | Data impact |
|---------|-----------------|-------------|
| Validation spike on pilot tenant | Clear allowlist entry | Package path resumes |
| Wrong definition version | Re-assign via Super Admin | No canonical tour rewrite |
| Flag accidentally on prod | Set `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED=false` | Instant package path |

